    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41360" root="هنبت" body-key="h">
    
      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَنْبَتَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَنْبَتَةٌ</span>, <i>He was languid
and sluggish.</i> (IKtt, K.) It may be said that
the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span> is augmentative, and that the word
is derived from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَبْتَةٌ</span>, signifying “ weakness. ”
(TA.)

